# field_store/objects holds the ONLY copy of states that cost GPU-hours, so this
# is a deployment limit rather than a judgement that they are disposable (`*.npz`
# above already catches them; this is here to be found). 7.4 GB does not belong
# in git; see field_store.py PROMOTION for the lfs / release-tarball routes.
# field_store/index.json is NOT ignored and IS tracked, so the repo states what
# is held — 10/10 as of 2026-08-02, when the states were recovered from
# null-worldtube-private. What is MISSING stays derivable from the tracked
# catalog regardless.
# See src/soliton_playground/ehn_lab/field_store.py, RECOVERY and PROMOTION.
field_store/objects/
!field_store/index.json

